ode/runs/*
ode/equations/*.svg
ode/equations/*.csv
ode/equations/*.html
ode/equations/my_equation.*

# Local experiments and scratch work
/.experiments/

# Agent instruction files
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
